  << /ActualText (Enterprise AI has hit a wall\056 While 74\045 of organizations are investing heavily\054 execution remains shallow\054 only 28\045 have deployed an enterprise\055wide AI strategy\054 and 95\045 report zero return on initial GenAI investments\056 To investigate this gap\054 MarketsandMarkets surveyed 380\053 enterprise leaders alongside independent benchmarks to determine the precise architecture required to scale autonomous\054 agentic AI\056 The research revealed a )
