485 0 obj
  << /ActualText (massive system fragmentation bottleneck\072 organizations manage an average of 957 applications\054 leaving half of all AI agents operating in isolated silos because they lack unified\054 machine\055executable context\056\n\nThis white paper outlines a critical architectural shift from temporary overlays to a graph\055based\054 vendor\055lock\055in\055free knowledge infrastructure\056 The study reveals that standard context layers and thin BI semantic layers \050like the OSI initiative\051 leave agents dependent on inconsistent LLM guessing\056 Instead\054 it highlights how Graphwise delivers a standards\055based Semantic Backbone built on W3C graph standards \050RDF\057OWL\057SKOS\051\056 By pairing this with an operational \034dashcam\035 called the Context Graph and executing SHACL constraints via platforms like Graphwise\054 this infrastructure achieves 100\045 explainable reasoning\054 a 2x accuracy boost over schema\055less RAG\054 and a 70\045 to 90\045 reduction in AI hallucinations\056\n\nDownload this white paper to discover the exact structural roadmap your organization needs to establish a good foundation\054 activate autonomous enterprise intelligence\054 and successfully deploy trusted\054 scalable Agentic AI\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 486 0 R
     /Pg 479 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
